:: MP NPC Ash Extra Hub [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpNpcs to ($mpNpcs or {})>><<set $mpNpcs.ash to ($mpNpcs.ash or {})>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.ash>><<set _axis to (_npc.axis or 0)>><<set _love to (_npc.love or 0)>><<set _trust to (_npc.trust or 0)>>
火塘里的松柴快烧透了。阿什用树枝把炭拨到一起，火苗重新立起来，照出石圈外一圈湿脚印。他没急着开口，只往旁边挪了挪，把烤热的半块石头让出来。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回阿什身边 (0:02)|MP NPC Ash Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br><<socialiseicon>><<link [[聊聊日常 (0:03)|MP NPC Ash Daily Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<<if _axis gte 15 or _trust gte 5>>
<br><<mphearticon>><<link [[一起出门 (0:03)|MP NPC Ash Date Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<<if _axis gte 35 or _trust gte 12>>
<br><<investigateicon>><<link [[人情往来 (0:03)|MP NPC Ash Social Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<<if _axis gte 60 and _love gte 20>>
<br><<link [[更多近况 (0:03)|MP NPC Ash More Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<<if _axis lt 15 and _trust lt 5>>
<br><span class="mp-ro-locked">话还没说到能一起出门的份上。他把你当搭把手的人，还不到同路的人。</span>
<<elseif _axis lt 35 and _trust lt 12>>
<br><span class="mp-ro-locked">林子里那些人与人之间的旧账，他还没打算摊开给你看。</span>
<<elseif _axis lt 60 or _love lt 20>>
<br><span class="mp-ro-locked">再往深里的近况，他仍压着没说。火候不到，问了也是白问。</span>
<</if>>

:: MP NPC Lin Extra Hub [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpNpcs to ($mpNpcs or {})>><<set $mpNpcs.lin to ($mpNpcs.lin or {})>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.lin>>
<<if _npc.watch is undefined>><<set _npc.watch to Math.round(((_npc.trustManor || 20) + (_npc.trustDomus || 20) + (_npc.trustHigh || 15)) / 3)>><</if>>
<<set _axis to (_npc.watch or 0)>><<set _love to (_npc.love or 0)>><<set _trust to (_npc.trust or 0)>>
岗棚的煤油灯捻得很低，灯芯结了一层炭花。林恩把巡夜簿合上，用指节压平卷起的纸角，才抬眼看你：「今晚的班还没排完。你想说闲话，还是想找点正事做？」
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回林恩身边 (0:02)|MP NPC Lin Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br><<socialiseicon>><<link [[聊聊日常 (0:03)|MP NPC Lin Daily Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<<if _axis gte 15 or _trust gte 5>>
<br><<mphearticon>><<link [[一起出门 (0:03)|MP NPC Lin Date Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<<if _axis gte 35 or _trust gte 12>>
<br><<investigateicon>><<link [[人情往来 (0:03)|MP NPC Lin Social Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<<if _axis gte 60 and _love gte 20>>
<br><<link [[更多近况 (0:03)|MP NPC Lin More Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<<if _axis lt 15 and _trust lt 5>>
<br><span class="mp-ro-locked">他还没打算把巡夜的路线和你并到一起走。</span>
<<elseif _axis lt 35 and _trust lt 12>>
<br><span class="mp-ro-locked">街面上那些人情账，他仍只同你核数目，不讲来路。</span>
<<elseif _axis lt 60 or _love lt 20>>
<br><span class="mp-ro-locked">再深一层的话，要等他先把你当成自己人。</span>
<</if>>

:: MP NPC Monet Extra Hub [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpNpcs to ($mpNpcs or {})>><<set $mpNpcs.monet to ($mpNpcs.monet or {})>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.monet>><<set _axis to (_npc.axis or 0)>><<set _love to (_npc.love or 0)>><<set _trust to (_npc.trust or 0)>>
阁楼的天窗半开着，颜料和松节油的气味被风吹得满屋都是。莫奈把画笔搁进洗笔罐，扯过一块抹布擦手，眼睛却还留在未干的画布上：「站远一点。你挡着光了。」
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回莫奈身边 (0:02)|MP NPC Monet Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br><<socialiseicon>><<link [[聊聊日常 (0:03)|MP NPC Monet Daily Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<<if _axis gte 15 or _trust gte 5>>
<br><<mphearticon>><<link [[一起出门 (0:03)|MP NPC Monet Date Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<<if _axis gte 35 or _trust gte 12>>
<br><<investigateicon>><<link [[人情往来 (0:03)|MP NPC Monet Social Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<<if _axis gte 60 and _love gte 20>>
<br><<link [[更多近况 (0:03)|MP NPC Monet More Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<<if _axis lt 15 and _trust lt 5>>
<br><span class="mp-ro-locked">她肯让你看画，还没肯让你陪她走出这间阁楼。</span>
<<elseif _axis lt 35 and _trust lt 12>>
<br><span class="mp-ro-locked">画框背后的那些人和账，她仍拿亚麻布盖着。</span>
<<elseif _axis lt 60 or _love lt 20>>
<br><span class="mp-ro-locked">再往深里的话，她还没打算画进你们之间。</span>
<</if>>

:: MP NPC Noel Extra Hub [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpNpcs to ($mpNpcs or {})>><<set $mpNpcs.noel to ($mpNpcs.noel or {})>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.noel>><<set _axis to (_npc.axis or 0)>><<set _love to (_npc.love or 0)>><<set _trust to (_npc.trust or 0)>>
标本室的风箱低低响着。诺艾尔把一只玻璃罐放回架子，指腹在标签上抹了一下，确认字迹没糊，才转过身：「你来得正好。这些事我一个人做不完，可也不想随便找个人。」
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回诺艾尔身边 (0:02)|MP NPC Noel Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br><<socialiseicon>><<link [[聊聊日常 (0:03)|MP NPC Noel Daily Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<<if _axis gte 15 or _trust gte 5>>
<br><<mphearticon>><<link [[一起出门 (0:03)|MP NPC Noel Date Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<<if _axis gte 35 or _trust gte 12>>
<br><<investigateicon>><<link [[人情往来 (0:03)|MP NPC Noel Social Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<<if _axis gte 60 and _love gte 20>>
<br><<link [[更多近况 (0:03)|MP NPC Noel More Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<<if _axis lt 15 and _trust lt 5>>
<br><span class="mp-ro-locked">她愿意分你一点活干，还没愿意让你陪她走校门。</span>
<<elseif _axis lt 35 and _trust lt 12>>
<br><span class="mp-ro-locked">哈珀的来信和药圃的账，她仍锁在抽屉最里面。</span>
<<elseif _axis lt 60 or _love lt 20>>
<br><span class="mp-ro-locked">母株背后的事，她还没找到能开口的时机。</span>
<</if>>

:: MP NPC Sera Extra Hub [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpNpcs to ($mpNpcs or {})>><<set $mpNpcs.sera to ($mpNpcs.sera or {})>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.sera>>
<<if _npc.cadence is undefined>><<set _npc.cadence to 25>><</if>>
<<set _axis to (_npc.cadence or 0)>><<set _love to (_npc.love or 0)>><<set _trust to (_npc.trust or 0)>>
修表台上一只拆开的机芯摊在绒布上，齿轮排得像一小片星空。塞拉用镊子夹起游丝，头也没抬：「别碰桌子。有事就说，手不能停。」
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回塞拉身边 (0:02)|MP NPC Sera Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br><<socialiseicon>><<link [[聊聊日常 (0:03)|MP NPC Sera Daily Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<<if _axis gte 15 or _trust gte 5>>
<br><<mphearticon>><<link [[一起出门 (0:03)|MP NPC Sera Date Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<<if _axis gte 35 or _trust gte 12>>
<br><<investigateicon>><<link [[人情往来 (0:03)|MP NPC Sera Social Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<<if _axis gte 60 and _love gte 20>>
<br><<link [[更多近况 (0:03)|MP NPC Sera More Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<<if _axis lt 15 and _trust lt 5>>
<br><span class="mp-ro-locked">她肯让你站在柜台外看，还没肯让你陪她出门。</span>
<<elseif _axis lt 35 and _trust lt 12>>
<br><span class="mp-ro-locked">父亲留下的那些旧事，她仍只同齿轮讲。</span>
<<elseif _axis lt 60 or _love lt 20>>
<br><span class="mp-ro-locked">阁楼上还压着一层话，她没打算现在说。</span>
<</if>>

:: MP NPC Vesper Extra Hub [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpNpcs to ($mpNpcs or {})>><<set $mpNpcs.vesper to ($mpNpcs.vesper or {})>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.vesper>><<set _axis to (_npc.axis or 0)>><<set _love to (_npc.love or 0)>><<set _trust to (_npc.trust or 0)>>
潮位档的木门被风吹得磕了一下。维斯把舱单压在铜坠下面，抬了抬下巴示意你坐：「今晚的潮不急。你要问什么，趁现在。」
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回维斯身边 (0:02)|MP NPC Vesper Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br><<socialiseicon>><<link [[聊聊日常 (0:03)|MP NPC Vesper Daily Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<<if _axis gte 15 or _trust gte 5>>
<br><<mphearticon>><<link [[一起出门 (0:03)|MP NPC Vesper Date Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<<if _axis gte 35 or _trust gte 12>>
<br><<investigateicon>><<link [[人情往来 (0:03)|MP NPC Vesper Social Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<<if _axis gte 60 and _love gte 20>>
<br><<link [[更多近况 (0:03)|MP NPC Vesper More Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<<if _axis lt 15 and _trust lt 5>>
<br><span class="mp-ro-locked">他只把你当码头上脸熟的人，还没到同船出港的份上。</span>
<<elseif _axis lt 35 and _trust lt 12>>
<br><span class="mp-ro-locked">舱单背后那些交货人的名字，他不打算让你先知道。</span>
<<elseif _axis lt 60 or _love lt 20>>
<br><span class="mp-ro-locked">末班夜航底下还压着一层话，他仍按着不说。</span>
<</if>>
